  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trivial Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>A mark of the Chaos Gods appears somewhere on your body; as a birthmark, a scarring, a tattoo or something similar. Consult the @Table[hitloc]{Hit Locations} Table to determine where. Then roll on the table below to see which mark that adorns you. If you already have a Chaos Patron, then you receive their mark. Showing the Mark to a Chaos worshipper will give you +5 Fellowship, or a +10 if they pray to the same Chaos God as your Mark.</p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>1d10</p></td><td><p>Result</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1-2</p></td><td><p>Chaos Star: the circle of chaotic arrows (Chaos Undivided)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3-4</p></td><td><p>Khorne</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5-6</p></td><td><p>Nurgle</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7-8</p></td><td><p>Slaanesh</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9-10</p></td><td><p>Tzeentch</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
